    "sections": {
        "description": "Job Forum is a theme designed for job boards, employment websites, and a job portal, offering compatibility with commonly used plugins such as form builders, SEO tools, and performance optimization solutions. It provides flexible layout options that allow administrators to create pages for both job seekers and employers, along with customizable header and footer areas and multiple blog layouts that adjust to different screen sizes. Users can filter listings by category, location, or job type, supporting easier navigation across the site. The theme includes social media integration for sharing updates and content, and incorporates accessibility features to improve usability for a wider audience. It is suitable for use by a recruitment agency, a staffing agency, or platforms that support freelance writers and operate as a freelance marketplace. Dedicated sections are available for posting jobs, managing applications, displaying testimonials, and presenting company profiles. Its lightweight structure supports efficient loading, while organized content areas and standard plugin compatibility help streamline the management of listings and professional information."
    },
